sequenceDiagram
participant D as Debtor
participant DA as Debtor Agent
participant M as Intermediary Agent 1 or Instructed or Instructing Reimbursement Agent
participant CA as Creditor Agent
participant C as Creditor
DA->>M: FIToFICustomerCreditTransfer
M->>DA: FIToFIPaymentStatusReport
M->>CA: FIToFICustomerCreditTransfer
CA->>M: FIToFIPaymentStatusReport
alt Case A: intermediary has not booked debtor-agent account
M->>DA: PaymentStatusReport
else Case B: intermediary has booked debtor-agent account
M->>DA: PaymentReturn
end
